631515"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/ba4cece62ab48f9e583b217d992d2bce9215472f/ss_ba4cece62ab48f9e583b217d992d2bce9215472f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768631515","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4017930/ba4cece62ab48f9e583b217d992d2bce9215472f/ss_ba4cece62ab48f9e583b217d992d2bce9215472f.600x338.jpg?t=1768631515"}],"short_description":"&quot;I Have an Item&quot; is a tense multiplayer game of risk, reward, and item manipulation. Draw items from a pool, but beware: one wrong move can cost you everything. Push your luck. Or lose it all. Remember: this IS NOT about getting the most loot \u2014 it's about SURVIVAL.","steam_appid":4017930,"support_info":{"email":"voidheatcontact@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Russian","type":"game","website":null}